=== A: safety, one block, its neighbor's guarantee assumed
--- RST1 = 0
--- informal-kind, limit 5s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
M_in                         assume  unprocessed
G_out                        assert  proven        informal-kind
C_run                        cover   covered       informal-kind depth 2
--- RST1 = 1
--- informal-kind, limit 5s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
M_in                         assume  unprocessed
G_out                        assert  cex           informal-kind depth 1
C_run                        cover   covered       informal-kind depth 2
=== B: safety, the ring
--- informal-kind, limit 5s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
G_x                          assert  proven        informal-kind
G_y                          assert  proven        informal-kind
=== C: liveness, one block, its neighbor's guarantee assumed
--- informal-ic3, limit 5s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
M_in                         assume  unprocessed
G_out                        assert  proven        informal-ic3
C_out                        cover   covered       informal-ic3 depth 2
=== D: liveness, the ring
--- informal-ic3, limit 5s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
G_x                          assert  cex           informal-ic3 depth 3
verdict: the circular argument holds for safety and fails for liveness, where the ring never starts
